msgid "A SET of files (a ResourceNode: a directory, a logical group) HAS A SET of files AS ITS PART (E.D. 2026-11-14, «insiemi dentro insiemi»): the folder of a piece is part of its category, the category of the lapidary; a logical group (a selection made in the viewer, with a name and a role) can be part of a set. The edge carries in its \\`attributes\\` the PATH of the child under its parent (\\`path\\`, e.g. 'Blocchi/18383'), as has\\_file carries a file's. The tree is read by s3dgraphy.resources.sets (sub\\_resources, set\\_tree, tree\\_rows) and is the tree of a CATALOGUE (s3dgraphy.resources.catalog): the document links the root, the leaves are its entries, cited «D.30 · 18383». Never a cycle."
msgstr ""

